ugrep-indexer
------------------------------------------
Monotonic indexer to speed up grepping by >10x

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libbrotlidec1-1.2.1-1
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  liblz4_1-1.9.4-1
  liblzma5-5.8.4-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libzstd1-1.5.7-1
  zlib0-1.4-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libbrotli-devel-1.2.1-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  liblz4-devel-1.9.4-1
  liblzma-devel-5.8.4-1
  libzstd-devel-1.5.7-1
  make-4.4.1-2
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/Genivia/ugrep-indexer

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/Genivia/ugrep-indexer/archive/refs/tags/v1.0.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack ugrep-indexer-1.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./ugrep-indexer-1.0.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/ugrep-indexer-1.0.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/ugrep-indexer-1.0.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(ugrep-indexer)
  /usr/bin/ugrep-indexer.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/ugrep-indexer.README
  /usr/share/doc/ugrep-indexer/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/ugrep-indexer/README.md
  /usr/share/man/man1/ugrep-indexer.1.gz

